 </div> </div>When in doubt...stick it in the Errata thread anyways and let the devs decide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-31T13:19:19-07:00","id":1263866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1263835-guide-to-the-night-live-on-drpg?p=1263857#post1263857\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Your metric for &quot;so many&quot; appears to be &quot;just the one.&quot;<br /> <br /> It tells you a vampire character's <i>entire Discipline spread</i> on a regular success at an uncontested and unresisted roll. That's valuable information. It might be only 3 Experiences valuable rather than four, but it's not nothing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bend Space costs 5, too (it's 6 total dots). And I thought there was another but going back over it I guess I made a mistake in my first glance through. Sorry for the exaggeration, I guess?<br /> <br /> And I never said Blood Scenting is useless or bad or anything, I said it's not worth 4XP. That's good info to know, but 2-3XP is plenty for what it does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_